    62	/** Reads `integration:` (D-015) from the officina manifest. An absent
    63	 *  block, an absent bisellium.yml (tests routinely give `mergeOpusBranch` a
    64	 *  bare studio dir with only opera/ in it), or an unparseable manifest all
    65	 *  fall back to today's only behaviour — fast-forward only, no push, no PR.
    66	 *  `bisellium check` is what blocks a malformed manifest; this reader is
    67	 *  defensive, not a second validator. */
